{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 20,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Rich Oppressors Will Be Judged"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Come now, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " rich, weep and howl for your miseries that are coming upon "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you!"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Your riches "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "have rotted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "are corrupted, and your garments are moth-eaten. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Your gold and silver are corroded, and their corrosion will be a witness against you and will eat your flesh like fire. You have heaped up treasure in the last days. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Indeed the wages of the laborers who mowed your fields, which you kept back by fraud, cry out; and the cries of the reapers have reached the ears of the Lord of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit., in Heb., Hosts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Sabaoth. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have lived on the earth in pleasure and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "indulgence"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "luxury; you have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. nourished"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fattened your hearts "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "as in a day of slaughter. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have condemned, you have murdered the just; he does not resist you."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Be Patient and Persevering"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore be patient, brethren, until the coming of the Lord. See "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "how"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the farmer waits for the precious fruit of the earth, waiting patiently for it until it receives the early and latter rain. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You also be patient. Establish your hearts, for the coming of the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "has drawn near"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "is at hand."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. groan"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "grumble against one another, brethren, lest you be "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M judged"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "condemned. Behold, the Judge is standing at the door! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "My brethren, take the prophets, who spoke in the name of the Lord, as an example of suffering and patience. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Indeed we count them blessed who endure. You have heard of the perseverance of Job and seen the end "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "intended by"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the Lord—that the Lord is very compassionate and merciful."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But above all, my brethren, do not swear, either by heaven or by earth or with any other oath. But let your “Yes” be “Yes,” and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " “No,” “No,” lest you fall into "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M hypocrisy"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "judgment."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Meeting Specific Needs"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Is anyone among you suffering? Let him pray. Is anyone cheerful? Let him sing psalms. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Is anyone among you sick? Let him call for the elders of the church, and let them pray over him, anointing him with oil in the name of the Lord. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the prayer of faith will save the sick, and the Lord will raise him up. And if he has committed sins, he will be forgiven. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU Therefore confess your sins"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Confess "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " trespasses to one another, and pray for one another, that you may be healed. The effective, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "supplication"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "fervent prayer of a righteous man avails much. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Elijah was a man with a nature like ours, and he prayed earnestly that it would not rain; and it did not rain on the land for three years and six months. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he prayed again, and the heaven gave rain, and the earth produced its fruit."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Bring Back the Erring One"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, if anyone among you wanders from the truth, and someone turns him back, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "let him know that he who turns a sinner from the error of his way will save "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU his soul"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "a soul from death and cover a multitude of sins."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}